{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/2105-so-how-is-deceived-coming-along","id":2105,"title":"So how is Deceived coming along?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-03T15:29:07-08:00","id":2105,"title":"So how is Deceived coming along?","content":"How is the Book of the Deceived coming along? I'm pretty excited for it, the sixth guild seems like it's gonna be my favorite antagonists for the Arisen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T19:26:29-08:00","id":2300,"title":"","content":"I'm likewise very curious about how that book is coming along.<br /> <br /> From the e-mail backers of the Mummy Kickstarter get it started being written in early September (in the second week I think). So theoretically it might be in editing now I guess. I've poked Rich about it once a week for the last two weeks during his Monday meeting announcements. However, he'd not been asking CAS for an update during the first week and CAS simply did not give him one in the second week. <br /> <br /> My presumption is that an update on it will be included in the next Monday Meeting blog post. As we know everyone sat down during the middle of last week to do release schedule alterations. Which have now been applied to the schedule on this website. According to that Deceived is still on track for December. However, we won't know until the Monday Meeting blog. If nothing new is included I might poke Rich again about it then via the blog replies. <br /> <br /> Basically, if its not in editing now there is no way its going to get a release before the new year. Art and layout alone take a month at least, not to mention proofs and approvals. With the holiday season coming up I'm expecting delays. (Which is a bugger, because I really need them to resolve certain background plot points in my current Mummy game.)<br /> <br /> As for content, I suspect from all the hints dropped about them that the Sixth Guild is going to be less outright antagonistic then any of the other &quot;bad guys&quot; in the Mummy book. They are being presented as an alternate choice for players after all. So I suspect they will be pretty engaging and sympathetic anti-villains at worst. At best they are the strong-willled rebel anti-hero's as opposed to the Arisen's compliant loyalist &quot;dark hero&quot; archetype.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>&quot;There is no God in the Badlands.&quot; </i></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Sunny</span></span><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img41/8167/obcp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/599-hawthorn","name":"Hawthorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar599_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-04T07:40:32-08:00","id":2610,"title":"","content":"I checked the release schedule posted here at it lists it as 4 or 5 out of 7, which I believe means that the book is in editing/art direction. According to the schedule the next book due out is Necropolis: DC. I imagine we wont see this book until after December. Maybe CAS could comment since he ocassionally checks these fora.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-04T08:35:58-08:00","id":2644,"title":"","content":"The updated schedule (Link: <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/schedule/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/schedule/</a>) has Necropolis DC pushed back to March 2014.<br /> <br /> Not that surprising as its just gone into its first round of editing I believe. The writing period alone for that book has taken about 4/5 months for some reason. So giving it another 5 for re-writes editing, art and layout is likely a good idea.<br /> <br /> Book of the Deceived at current has no status bar to tell us what stage of development its at. Hence my and TiwazTyrsfist speculation about the books current status. I speculate that you might be working off an old schedule and possibly confusing another products progress bar for Book of the Deceived's. Remember that Mummy progress bars are sand coloured. Although you might have to a schedule I am not aware of.<br /> <br /> As I mentioned previously I am hoping that the Monday Meeting blog post sheds some light on this issue. CAS may comment, but with the exception of Mummy's initial release I don't recall him posting much in the old forums.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>&quot;There is no God in the Badlands.&quot; </i></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Sunny</span></span><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img41/8167/obcp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/599-hawthorn","name":"Hawthorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar599_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T00:15:02-08:00","id":3244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hawthorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/2105-so-how-is-deceived-coming-along?p=2644#post2644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The updated schedule (Link: <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/schedule/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/schedule/</a>) has Necropolis DC pushed back to March 2014.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow...I'm actually relieved DC got pushed back. My wallet is getting smaller by the day (everyone is throwing amazing stuff at me...wonder why?). I'm actually excited for the book because it's my first city book I've ever bought and read.<br /> <br /> As for the Deceived, I am super excited and I REALLY want the book. But from the new schedule I'm not expecting it until next year. Oh well, Guildhalls and the Ready Made PC's will have to keep me busy for now (and Demon if it comes out before 2014 too).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/410-ristigger","name":"RisTigger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar410_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T06:08:08-08:00","id":3413,"title":"","content":"Ah you are quite correct, I mistakenly thought the status bar was for this book and not for the book next to it. Well, Im still making my way through Guildhalls so I have something to keep me busy till March.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T19:07:34-08:00","id":3934,"title":"","content":"Currently I am waiting on Ritch's reply to a post I made on the blog this week. At current though Deceived is being red-lined meaning its still in the writing process and a bit ahead of DC. So I suspect we are looking at a January or February release date. Unless a miracle happens. Or CAS tells me otherwise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>&quot;There is no God in the Badlands.&quot; </i></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Sunny</span></span><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img41/8167/obcp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/599-hawthorn","name":"Hawthorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar599_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T05:40:01-08:00","id":4987,"title":"","content":"Ah so sooner than March?? That would be great if this book came out in January.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-08T10:23:38-08:00","id":6112,"title":"","content":"What do people want to see in Book of the Deceived? <br /> <br /> Personally I am interested in how the Deceived themselves will be presented mechanically. Are they the &quot;same&quot; sort of Mummy as the Arisen (we know they fit into the Deathless catagory of undead)? As sources conflict over them being part of the Rite of Return or if that came after the Sixth Guild was destroyed.<br /> <br /> Does name magic (Ren-Heku) have a unique system? Or is it a group of Guild specific utterances and affinities? <br /> <br /> Obviously the second set of questions is linked to the first. <br /> <br /> CAS wrote a lot of the Belial's Brood book. So I am using that as a primer really on the alterations that Deceived might suggest. Brood Vampires had the same basic template as other vampires, but they had several sets of unique abilities, rituals, a unique bloodline and ghoul family and a different structure to the rest of Kindred society. <br /> <br /> So the Deceived might well have the same base template as the Arisen, but will have several different types of unique thing bolted on. <br /> <br /> Likewise, while the Brood book made them into player characters, they were still chiefly antagonistic, hence they had some pretty nasty powers to represent the fact that they were often the opponents to your typical player group. I'm thinking the Deceived might have a little more bang-for-their-buck then the Arisen, which is really saying something when you think about how tough and powerful the Mummy base template is especially with the right utterances and affinities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>&quot;There is no God in the Badlands.&quot; </i></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Sunny</span></span><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img41/8167/obcp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/599-hawthorn","name":"Hawthorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar599_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-08T23:25:05-08:00","id":6658,"title":"","content":"Hi, guys.<br /> <br /> Joe's got the right of it. We've got <i>Guildhalls</i> going live for POD orders this week (woot), and then it's all about the first settingbook -- <i>D.C.</i> -- until the new year.<br /> <br /> As to <i>Book of the Deceived</i>, that's in-progress now and I'm pretty thrilled with how it's shaping up. As others mentioned, it's effectively the <i>Belial's Brood </i>of this line, and so I wanted to take a similarly direct hand in its development, which means I'm also one of the writing team this time around (whereas I will <b>not</b> be writing much on the next three sourcebooks for the line).<br /> <br /> Look for a Lost Guild teaser on the Mummy page/blog later in the month, but I'll tease one thing here by answering Hawthorn's question straight up: Yep, the Deceived are analogous to the Brood on <i>that</i> axis, as well. Unlike the Shuankhsen, they are technically Deathless (not Lifeless), and therefore operate under similar base assumptions as the Arisen. That said, they're a fundamentally different breed of Deathless being, and as such, expect to see a larger difference, mechanically speaking, between them and the Arisen than there was between Brood vampires and those of other covenants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/277-cas","name":"CAS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar277_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T07:33:05-08:00","id":6806,"title":"","content":"Wow a direct reply from the head dev.<br /> <br /> I feel kinda honoured.<br /> <br /> Does anyone else know who's writing on the book besides CAS? Guildhalls had about 5 writers due to its more partitioned nature. I was wondering if the number of Decieved was greater or lesser. As it would likely benefit (in tone and focus at least) from having less writers. <br /> <br /> Also, if CAS would be kind enough to pop onto this thread again I do have two other questions:<br /> <br /> 1) Is the priority now to work on D.C with the aim of getting it out sometime between December and March (its new release date) and then focus on Deceived or are the two projects being worked concurrently. As D.C is in editing I believe while Deceived is being red-lined for rewrites and additional content.<br /> <br /> 2) You mentioned in an interview that each of the pictures at the start of the various chapters in the Mummy core book represent the &quot;signature characters&quot; of the line. Even the nasty looking Shuankhsen art was the signature character for those Lifeless. So I was wondering if the Deceived signature character was already previewed in the core sneakily or if he/she will show up in the upcoming book.<br /> <br /> Very excited about the preview for Deceived that will be up this month on the blogs. Looking forward to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>&quot;There is no God in the Badlands.&quot; </i></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Sunny</span></span><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img41/8167/obcp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/599-hawthorn","name":"Hawthorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar599_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T09:11:22-08:00","id":6871,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CAS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/2105-so-how-is-deceived-coming-along?p=6658#post6658\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi, guys.<br /> <br /> Joe's got the right of it. We've got <i>Guildhalls</i> going live for POD orders this week (woot), and then it's all about the first settingbook -- <i>D.C.</i> -- until the new year.<br /> <br /> As to <i>Book of the Deceived</i>, that's in-progress now and I'm pretty thrilled with how it's shaping up. As others mentioned, it's effectively the <i>Belial's Brood </i>of this line, and so I wanted to take a similarly direct hand in its development, which means I'm also one of the writing team this time around (whereas I will <b>not</b> be writing much on the next three sourcebooks for the line).<br /> <br /> Look for a Lost Guild teaser on the Mummy page/blog later in the month, but I'll tease one thing here by answering Hawthorn's question straight up: Yep, the Deceived are analogous to the Brood on <i>that</i> axis, as well. Unlike the Shuankhsen, they are technically Deathless (not Lifeless), and therefore operate under similar base assumptions as the Arisen. That said, they're a fundamentally different breed of Deathless being, and as such, expect to see a larger difference, mechanically speaking, between them and the Arisen than there was between Brood vampires and those of other covenants.</div> </div> </div> </div>Awesome CAS, that is what I thought. I've been following the progress on the Mummy FB page. Since I've been running my campaign in DC Im really thrilled to see what Arisen society looks like in the signature city of Mummy.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the post!!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T18:21:58-08:00","id":55089,"title":"","content":"I do hate to engage in thread necromancy (every pun intended) but I was wondering if people had heard any news about the development of the Deceived sourcebook?<br /> <br /> Its just that there has been very little movement on it that we have been aware of since CAS is post in this thread two months ago. The Monday Morning new blog seems to imply the thing is in some kind of Red-lining limbo (honestly 6 weeks to redline a text? Are they rewriting the whole thing?)<br /> <br /> Likewise, CAS never did post a preview, so we are still none the wiser as to what'a actually in store for us in the book. <br /> <br /> While I do try and keep an eye out for news on future Mummy releases across various sites. I was wondering if anyone else had heard anything. As I have not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>&quot;There is no God in the Badlands.&quot; </i></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Sunny</span></span><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img41/8167/obcp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/599-hawthorn","name":"Hawthorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar599_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}